      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-293569",
      ":question/problem": "Last week, Thumper's ice cream parlor achieved median sales of $$140$ per day. The total daily sales of Bambi's ice cream parlor over the same $7$ day period are as follows:\n$$120, $135, $135, $140, $145, $150, $170$\nWhich of the following statement are true?\n\n1. Bambi's ice cream parlor achieved median sales of $$140$ per day.\n2. The median sales achieved by Thumper's parlor exceed that of Bambi's.\n3. A comparison of the medians suggests that Thumper's store is more popular overall with customers wanting ice cream.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
